Provenance and licensing for the ``bag3d.export.ifc`` package
=============================================================

This package contains the CityJSON-to-IFC conversion logic used by the
3DBAG pipeline's IFC export.

Vendored files
--------------

The following files were copied from the IFC3DBAG repository
(https://github.com/tudelft3d/IFC3DBAG), which is itself a fork of the
``ifccityjson`` converter from IfcOpenShell
(https://github.com/IfcOpenShell/IfcOpenShell/tree/master/src/ifccityjson):

- ``geometry.py``      - copied verbatim (LGPL-3.0-or-later)
- ``cityjson2ifc.py``  - copied, with one change (see below)

Both files are licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License
(LGPL), version 3 or (at your option) any later version. See their file
headers and http://www.gnu.org/licenses/ for the license text.

