Modifications
-------------

- ``cityjson2ifc.py``: the import ``from geometry import GeometryIO`` was
  changed to ``from .geometry import GeometryIO`` so the module works as part
  of the ``bag3d.export.ifc`` package.

- The original ``batch_converter.py`` (click CLI + multiprocessing + unzip)
  was refactored into ``convert.py``. The single-tile conversion logic is
  unchanged; the CLI, process pool, and ``.city.json.gz`` unzip step were
  removed, and logging replaced ``click.echo``.

New files (Apache-2.0 / MIT, this repository)
--------------------------------------------

- ``convert.py`` - refactored conversion driver (see above). Uses ``cjio``
  0.9.x as a library dependency for CityJSON parsing and the object model
  (``cityjson.reader``, ``load_from_j``, ``get_cityobjects``).

- ``__init__.py`` - package exports.
